   "body_text": "Limited Edition Dino Print in Navy Meet the comfiest overalls on earth. Swoveralls combine sweatpants and overalls into one ridiculously comfy masterpiece. Made from butter-soft fabric with the perfect amount of stretch, they feature six pockets (including a hidden zip one), jogger cuffs that stay put, and a no-waistband design for all-day freedom. Great for concerts, dog walks, naps, travel, and everything in between. Super soft fabric blend Inside-bib, secret front pocket with zipper closure Deep front bib and side pockets Jogger Pant Cuff Adjustable Straps Zipper fly Unisex Sizing 65% cotton, 31% recycled polyester, 4% spandex",
