   "body_text": "Every hero needs a sidekick. For your Swoveralls or Swovie Shorts, this is it. Made from 100% ringspun cotton jersey, The Sidekick Tee is soft, breathable, and built to last. It is the only tee you’ll ever need whether you are rocking straps or going solo. Basic, no frills, just a perfect fit that works with everything. A small nod to the free waistband movement lives on the back, reminding everyone who does a double take that comfort is a way of life. Details 100% ringspun cotton jersey for a soft, lived-in feel from day one Pairs perfectly with Swoveralls or Swovie Shorts and looks great on its own Classic crew neck, timeless fit Pre-shrunk to keep its shape wash after wash Subtle free waistband graphic on the back",
